Author's note on originality
----------------------------

The selection, organization, severity grading, and Chinese descriptions of
the events in the Data are the original work of the author. Event identifiers
(`source`, `event_id`) are factual information and not subject to copyright.
Some descriptive text was drafted with AI assistance and subsequently
reviewed and revised by the author.

